Proxmox VE
The theme files are written for this project. They contain no code or CSS
from Proxmox VE, proxmox-widget-toolkit or pve-manager (AGPL-3.0); the
toolkit's own dark theme was read only to learn which ExtJS selectors a theme
has to cover. The installer copies the theme files into the toolkit's themes
directory and, only with --register, adds three entries to the theme list in
the installed proxmoxlib.js; that patch is a modification of an AGPL-3.0 file
on your node, whose source is available from Proxmox
(https://git.proxmox.com). The screenshots in docs/screenshots/ show a mock-up
with invented data, not the Proxmox VE interface itself.

